// BUnit coverage (ADR 0124 §9/B5b). Declares its own eager field only, no
// `late` slot of its own — `allFieldKinds` must still surface the
// inherited `late` slot from `LateFieldKindsBase` (fixtures/
// late_field_kinds_base.bt), while `fieldKinds` (local-only) must not.

LateFieldKindsBase subclass: LateFieldKindsSub
  state: extra :: Integer = 0
